---
title: Minestrone-Style Bean Soup
source: claude
servings: 4
tags: [soup, meatless, vegetarian, freezer, slow-cooker]
cook time: 7-8 hours
---

> About 13 g fiber and 14 g protein per serving.

Put @cannellini beans{15%oz}(drained), @kidney beans{15%oz}(drained), @diced tomatoes{28%oz}, @carrot{2}(chopped), @celery{2%stalks}(chopped), @onion{1}(chopped), @garlic{3%cloves}(minced), @frozen green beans{2%cups}, @italian seasoning{1%tbsp} and @vegetable broth{5%cups}(low-sodium) in a #slow cooker{}.

Cook on low for ~{7-8%hours}, or use the Instant Pot soup setting.

After reheating, stir in @kale{1%bunch}(chopped). On serving day, cook @pasta{1%bunch} and add it to the soup.
